  "notes": [
   "The page's Unit Requirements table prints Prerequisite Awards 36, Required Courses 18, Total Units 54; total_units records the printed 54, which includes the two prerequisite certificates (Building Construction Certificate of Achievement, 18 units, and Residential Construction Development Second Award, 18 units). These prerequisites are recorded as blocks; the third award's own requirement is the final 'Required Courses' block (select 18 units).",
   "The catalog states no course may be applied to more than one Residential Construction Development certificate, so the same course cannot count in more than one of the prerequisite/third-award blocks even though the lists overlap.",
   "Individual elective courses are printed without units beside them; units left null.",
   "ARCH/CNST A196 and ARCH/CNST A197 are printed as cross-listed codes; matched to closed-list CNST A196 and CNST A197.",
   "CNST A211 (Decorative Concrete) matched to the closed-list entry 'CNSTA211 Decorative Concret' (apparent typo in the state file).",
   "CNST A194, A150, A155, A156, A157, A189, A199 appear only in the prerequisite first-certificate list and are not in the closed list.",
   "The page header names this award 'Building Construction Third Award' while the URL and body text refer to Residential Construction Development certificates.",
   "The Program Learning Outcomes are printed on the award's overview tab and may be shared with the related construction certificates."
  ]
